WEBVTT

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.530
Out of my way!

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.080
Ernesta!

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.050
Embers!

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.640
Too slow.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.310
Wha—

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.990
My sister would have been much, much faster.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:51.590
Shingetsu-chan!

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:53.910
Mangetsu...

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.440
Are you okay?

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:59.660
I think some of the damage I took 
last time is still affecting me.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:00.940
Really?

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.570
What is that?

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.370
That light...

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.210
Not again!

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.010
This heat... No, it's magic.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:26.480
Ready to fire.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.390
Roger.

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:29.980
Nene-nee, give it all you've got!

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.590
Mother...

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:07.020
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:07.020
The Two Princeps

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.270
Nana! Mimi! Nene!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.650
Who did this?

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.450
You dummies! You were supposed to put it back!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:37.510
Nene!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.400
Yes?

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.820
What did I tell you?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.860
You must not use this power.

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.740
I'm sorry.

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:52.460
Magic techniques are used 
to control monsters.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.670
Even if the techniques 
don't use magical power,

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:58.600
they can still summon monsters.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.920
They can?

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:04.120
Yes. So each time you use one,

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:07.680
a monster takes another step 
toward you from the darkness.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.620
In darkness black as night, without a trace,

00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:14.530
without even a sound... and then...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.820
And then?

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.520
The next thing you know, 
it's right beside you,

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.730
ready to devour the soul of the 
one who used the technique.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:41.980
<i>Such power...</i>

00:04:42.560 --> 00:04:46.300
Even worse, that beam was 
chasing us, wasn't it?

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.180
So it has the ability to track a target?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.400
VIOLA KATZE, get behind me!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.900
You're all the same...

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.880
<i>Every last one of you!</i>

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:08.120
<i>Shingetsu, Shingetsu, Shingetsu, Shingetsu!</i>

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.530
You love that <i>thing</i> so much?!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:16.140
Her face... Her voice... Her hair?!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.550
Are you sure? That's how 
she takes everything away!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:30.170
Everything I loved... My entire life!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.270
Here it comes again!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.440
Ernesta!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.620
There it is!

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.040
Don't look...

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.930
I'm getting the hang of this!

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.940
I see it. Right there.

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.770
Her aim is getting sharper.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:35.870
When did you learn to...

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.470
I don't know!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:41.580
I can't see it, but I just sense 
where it's coming from, somehow!

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.770
<i>The moment she senses magical power...</i>

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:52.920
Mangetsu, this way! It'll have 
a harder time tracking us!

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.710
The moon...

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:02.190
How goes it?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.310
Drat! They're more resilient than I thought!

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.940
Well, only those who have survived every 
battle for the past year are still in the fight.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.070
Both they and their 
wishes are just that strong.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.960
<i>Hey... Do you think I can win this?</i>

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.180
Nene-nee...

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:21.190
<i>Just kidding.</i>

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.140
Of course I'm going to win.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.720
Our wish won't lose to anyone!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:42.840
It's been glowing this whole time.

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:47.920
My guess is her improved precision reduces 
the number of shots she needs.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:49.900
At this rate...

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:56.580
We have to act.

00:07:57.570 --> 00:08:00.060
But from this position, I can't...

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:05.390
Mangetsu, back me up!

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:05.920
Huh?!

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:15.070
You have total control now.

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.580
Nene-nee, all you need to do now is aim!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.390
What?!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:20.310
<i>Something's here!</i>

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.050
It's...

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.400
<i>Found you!</i>

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:29.480
So this is where you were hiding!

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.320
Not happening!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.040
She destroyed my barrier!

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.080
<i>Really? Already?</i>

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.040
<i>Get out of there! JI GUAN LONG 
can't handle close combat!</i>

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.000
But...

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.330
What?!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:11.690
There you are.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.370
<i>Now, Nene-nee!</i>

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.170
Damn!

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.330
<i>What's that sound?</i>

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.100
I don't like... this sound...

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.790
I've never seen that ARMANOX before!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:38.810
<i>Suishou!</i>

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.260
Oh, can it. I'm busy right now.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.480
A-hup!

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.970
The moon...

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.430
It's setting!

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.390
No way...

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.810
Is this...

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:39.820
What? What's happening?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:40.400
What...

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.800
<i>Just give up.</i>

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:44.080
<i>You can't escape this darkness.</i>

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.040
Time's up.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.500
No way! No way, no way, no way!

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.340
A dream?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.800
Shingetsu-cha—

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.010
Anna...

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:05.600
Anna?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.520
Forgive me...

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:23.310
Mangetsu...

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:28.480
I'm glad I participated in GRANBELM.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:29.330
Huh?

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:32.540
I want to win it now.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.490
So I can help make your wish come true.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:41.710
And then, for some reason, she 
was asleep in the bathroom.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:44.540
That's one carefree big sister you have—

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.390
Ow!

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:49.220
Are you okay? You should 
watch where you're walking.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.990
I know that!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.280
What is it?

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:03.280
You have an older sister?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.200
Yeah...

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.660
I don't care what you were in the middle of!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.500
When I call you during 
battle, you come to me!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.000
Okay!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.250
But it was because of my DROSELA that you—

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.620
The descendant of a low-ranked mage 
family dares to talk back to me?!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.890
Smiles!

00:12:25.460 --> 00:12:29.960
Get me the report on yesterday's battle and 
the data on all of the ARMANOX at once!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:31.690
You got it!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:42.010
It's been more than a year 
since GRANBELM began.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:45.400
There should be far fewer combatants now.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.950
What is it?

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:50.580
Onee-sama!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:51.970
Clare?

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:55.120
Onee-sama, I have news! Fantastic news!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.040
What is it?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:57.900
I found her school!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.940
The school Shingetsu goes to!

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:16.980
SETSGETS BAIKA...

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.510
It smelled like you, Onee-chan.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.910
Onee-chan...

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.840
Wait for me.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.440
<i>Well?</i>

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.400
It's reacting.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.430
<i>So there really is a mage's 
descendant close by.</i>

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.940
<i>You should really check her out.</i>

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:54.840
<i>She must have approached you 
because she sensed something.</i>

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.890
There's no way she knows!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.310
You think I'd do something 
stupid enough to give us away?

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.350
<i>Definitely!</i>

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:01.500
Shut it!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.770
Nene-chan?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.730
What's wrong?

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.010
I'll go make some tea.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:16.710
If it's not too much trouble...

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.920
Nana 
Send us a picture when you're done

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.500
Nana

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:24.210
<b>Fight!</b>

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.300
Mimi: Even better if you can find out 
what mage she's related to

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.300
Mimi

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.300
Guts

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:31.430
To the left...

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:45.440
You expect me to believe what you say?

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.410
This is the mech I saw.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.010
Wow...

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:54.410
It's a basic technique.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:58.000
It tries to snipe its target from a distance.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.460
That's still a flimsy reason 
for us to join forces.

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.420
Join forces?

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:07.070
I can detect where its attack will come from.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:10.380
But to make sure it doesn't 
get away, I need backup.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.660
Is that a flimsy reason?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:18.390
It's still possible you and this ARMANOX
 are secretly working together.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:24.080
You come from a family that, until a century 
ago, everyone in Eastern Europe knew...

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.710
The family they called the Mages of Refining.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:31.370
I'm sure they were once connected 
to my Tsuchimikado family.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:34.450
That was more than a century ago.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.160
Then I ask you this:

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:39.880
Why have you joined forces with this girl?

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:43.900
Why do you trust her when you don't 
know what mage she descends from?

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.540
Because...

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.420
I wouldn't mind teaming up with her.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.760
Mangetsu...

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.180
I mean, she...

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.760
Tsuchimikado Kuon.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.530
Right. Like Kuon-chan says,

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:01.220
if something doesn't change, 
it might end in a draw again.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.620
Yes, but...

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:15.490
Wh-What was that?

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:17.140
Who are you?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.250
U-Um... Where's your bathroom?

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.800
Oh, it's the door across the hall.

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:23.980
Who is this?

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.330
Kibou's friend, Nene-chan.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.260
Sorry for intruding.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.220
Well?

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.960
There's no sign of a technique in use.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:42.680
If she's a mage's descendant, there 
should be faint traces of her magic.

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:44.810
Innocent...

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.870
What? You suspect her?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.750
But she's in middle school!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.610
Age has nothing to do with it.

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.820
All mage descendants carry the same burden.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:57.710
They all strive to become the Princeps.

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:00.270
Well, bye!

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.650
Yeah... See you tomorrow.

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:15.880
They didn't figure out who I am.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.760
<i>Thank goodness for your 
magic-negating talismans.</i>

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.760
<i>And?</i>

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:23.140
There were three of them 
discussing how to defeat me.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.420
Really?

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:26.520
We've won now.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:29.360
So, what's their plan?

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.120
Huh?

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.670
Still, I'm surprised you 
figured out that Mangetsu

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:46.160
was participating in GRANBELM 
by such faint traces of magic.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.250
I don't "figure out" anything. 
I search for what's out of place.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.950
That's all.

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.210
Out of place?

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.220
Her younger sister transmits
 the sense that something's amiss.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.940
It's so pretty!

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:07.480
I didn't know there was 
a place like this here.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.430
Why are you two working together?

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.790
It's not exactly "working together."

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:18.140
Huh? It's not?

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.530
Well, no, I mean...

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:25.410
So long as you're in GRANBELM, you'll 
have to fight each other eventually.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:28.250
To work together, even knowing that...

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:30.210
seems unnatural.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.100
You think so?

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:37.800
I don't think it's that strange.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.260
Why?

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.450
That's just... how I feel.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.220
That's not enough?

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:50.220
What mage do you descend from?

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.880
Well...

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.700
We still don't know.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:01.280
The moment I touched you, 
something seemed very strange.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.890
You may be a new mage.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.250
A new...

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.710
I'll be fine from here.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:16.400
I'll contact you once I've written 
down the details of our strategy.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.720
Do you really think we should 
join forces with her?

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:26.960
I don't know, but I think she can help you.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.070
Me?

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.270
Yeah. That's the feeling I get.

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:33.650
Mangetsu...

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:38.120
If GRANBELM goes on

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:41.700
and you have to fight me someday,

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.100
what will you do?

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.280
What do you mean?

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.950
Will you fight me?

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:53.850
I don't know.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:55.540
You don't know?

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.550
I won't know until the time comes.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:01.510
But y'know, I really think...

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:04.230
you and I won't have to fight each other.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.240
Not ever.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:12.810
<b>1 Combo!</b>

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:13.270
<b>2 Combo!</b>

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:14.150
<b>3 Combo!</b>

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:14.850
<b>4 Combo!</b>

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:15.520
<b>5 Combo!</b>

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:16.150
<b>6 Combo!</b>

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:16.360
<b>All Clear!!</b>

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.870
You're a good girl. A super good girl.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.940
But... if you're a witch...

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.640
and that's why I never grow any bigger...

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:54.840
It's all right.

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:57.810
No matter where I am,

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.980
I'll always be your mother, 
and nothing can change that.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.220
Mother...

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.080
You must hide the fact that you are a mage.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:12.280
It's absolutely necessary 
if you're to survive.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:16.620
But there's no need to hate yourself.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:29.870
This?

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:32.720
Yes. It'll make your 
presence harder to detect.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:37.650
It's bitter!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.700
It's so bitter...

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:41.460
That just means it's working.

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:48.160
Is being a mage's descendant something 
we're supposed to keep hidden?

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:51.620
Mages have lived to deceive one 
another since ancient times.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:54.880
But there are some who don't want that,

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:57.790
so they don't hide their identities at all.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.630
<i>There's no need to hate yourself.</i>

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:12.330
Nene-chan?

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:16.310
I'm a mage's descendant, too.

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:20.430
I'm Nene, daughter of Lin Fen 
Fen, the feng shui master...

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:24.480
and I'm participating in GRANBELM.

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

